During some test runs it found gaps in our POMs so I fixed them to confirm smoother runs.
- **New POM methods:** `deleteAllVariables`, `clickOutlineElement`, `closeGhostCellInfoDialog`, `expectGhostCellInfoDialogElement`, ghost cell opt-in flow (5 methods), packages POM

