and the `next()` method dispatches.  

```rust
impl<'a> Iterator for EnvironmentIter<'a> {
    type Item = Binding;

    fn next(&mut self) -> Option<Self::Item> {
        match self {
            EnvironmentIter::Hashed(iter) => iter.next(),
            EnvironmentIter::NonHashed(iter) => iter.next()
        }
    }
}
